diagram.source:
flowchart TD
  CALL[Invoke fn] --> ARROW{Arrow?}
  ARROW -->|yes| LEX[Lexical this]
  ARROW -->|no| NEW{new?}
  NEW -->|yes| FRESH[new object]
  NEW -->|no| METH{obj.f()?}
  METH -->|yes| OBJ[this=obj]
  METH -->|no| DEF[default strict undefined]

